  "body": "* This property is now under contract; however, a limited window of opportunity remains for buyers to act and potentially secure this exceptional home. We encourage interested parties to contact us without delay.\r\n\r\nRich red brick, a tiled roof and an expansive near-flat 809 sqm freehold section - this is the Kiwi dream, thoughtfully brought into the present. Tucked away behind secure electric gates, the home combines sea views with a sense of privacy and the freedom for children and pets to roam.\r\n\r\nLast sold in November 2014, this is a home where all the hard work has been done. The renovation respects its original character while introducing the finish and comfort expected of contemporary living. Decorative ceilings and elegant character features sit comfortably alongside a modern kitchen and updated bathrooms, with double glazing and ducted central heating and cooling ensuring year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nThe living spaces open to a substantial deck, extending the home towards the sea views and creating an effortless setting for entertaining. Long lunches, evening drinks and quiet mornings find their place here, while the huge backyard below offers the space that makes a family home feel complete.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n\r\n* Near-flat 809 sqm freehold section, privately framed by established hedges and secured behind electric gates, with an extensive backyard for family life.\r\n\r\n* Renovated brick and tile home, double glazed with ducted central heating and cooling.\r\n\r\n* Sea views, connected kitchen and living spaces, a separate dining room and an expansive deck accessed through bifold doors.\r\n\r\n* Alarm system and security cameras around the home for added peace of mind.\r\n\r\n* Two lock-up garages, generous off-street parking, a separate downstairs sitting room and plentiful storage.\r\n\r\nThere is lasting appeal in a home that gets the fundamentals right: character, land, privacy and space. Here, those qualities are complemented by a considered renovation, leaving you free to settle in and enjoy. We look forward to welcoming you through.\r\n\r\nEnduring Character. Refined Living. Room to Roam.\r\n\r\n//  A N D R E W  F A V A",
